	"nodes":[
		{"id":"d1f839c9acc9e916","type":"text","text":"# 文字敏感词检验\n- PGOS升级\n- PlayerManagerPGOS.h中增加接口\n```cpp\n\nbool UPlayersManagerPGOS::CheckInput(const FString& Input)\n{\n    auto PlayerProfile = IPgosSDKCpp::Get().GetClientPlayerProfileAPI();  \n    if (PlayerProfile)  \n    {\n\t    TWeakObjectPtr<UPlayersManagerPGOS> WeakPtr = this;  \n\t    PlayerProfile->CheckInput(Params, [WeakPtr](const FPgosResult& Ret, const Pgos::FPgosCheckInputResult* Data) {  \n\t        if (WeakPtr.IsValid())  \n\t        {             \n\t\t        WeakPtr->CheckInputCallback(Ret, Data);  \n\t        } \n        });  \n    }\n}\n\nvoid UPlayersManagerPGOS::CheckInputCallback(const FPgosResult& Ret, const Pgos::FPgosCheckInputResult* Data) \n{\n\t// 响应一个Delegate\n}\n```\n\nlua中\n```lua\n  \nfunction init()\n\tself.PlayersManager = UE.UInstanceBlueprintFunctionLibrary.GetPlayerManager(self)\n\tself.PlayersManager.OnEventBatchGetPlayerInfoResult:Remove(self, self.OnEventBatchGetPlayerInfoResult)  \n\tself.PlayersManager.OnEventBatchGetPlayerInfoResult:Add(self, self.OnEventBatchGetPlayerInfoResult)\nend\n    \n      \nfunction M:OnEventBatchGetPlayerInfoResult(errCode, Data)\n\nend\n\n```\n\n\n\n","x":-560,"y":-20,"width":906,"height":460},
